  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR: Protection Monitoring 3-Month Phase-Out Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a 3-month phase-out of the UNHCR-funded protection monitoring project implemented by War Child UK in the Kasai since 2017. As for 2022 UNHCR has decided to continue the project with a different partner, a 3-month transitional agreement was made with War Child UK enabling us to safely phase out activities and hand them over to incoming partner AVSI.</narrative>
  </description>
